; xfail: fnbug/pick.scaly:7:9: error: null assigned to a non-optional reference
;
; env: SCALY_HOME=tests/regress/xfail_diagnostic_file_fn_home
; args: --no-prelude
;
; Regression (2026-09-25): the FREE-function twin of xfail_diagnostic_file. A
; generic free function is instantiated lazily from its call site, outside the
; module walk that maintains the planner's current file, and a `Model.Function`
; carries no file -- so a diagnostic raised in its body was rendered against
; the CALLER's file at the callee's offsets (this compile answered
; `xfail_diagnostic_file_fn.scaly:7:76`, a position in THIS file's comment).
; `register_function#` records the file now (`function_origin_files`) and
; `instantiate_generic_function#` installs it around the body, as
; `instantiate_generic#` does for a concept.

package fnbug 0.1.0

define Thing (v: int)

var t Thing(7)
let r first_of[Thing](&t as pointer[Thing], 0)
